  text: Advanced spreadsheet skills. You can build a capacity model that someone else can pick up and trust.
  text: Experience with territory design, account assignment, or capacity planning is a big plus.
  text: You explain data clearly to people who don't live in it, and you can tell a CSM, a director, and a VP what a number means for them.
  text: You're careful with details and still move fast. Reporting that's late or wrong doesn't help anyone.
  text: You're curious about why the number moved, not just what it is.
  text: You build tools and processes you'd want to inherit, not just ones that get you through this week.
